<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.home.tends ~ the the operator's homes tunnel converges, each write a ledger generation

`lares home tend` reads first, then writes only the items that drift (and, with `force=true`, the foreign ones, the ledger keeping the bytes it replaced), under the host lock and the radius lock; each tend that writes records one ledger generation `undo` restores. A home tend writes the operator's homes, so it asks at a terminal and takes `yes=true` with none; withheld consent exits 2. `familiar=<pet>` names the familiar whose hooks it seats.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ tend · force

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`tend` params=`~ converge the operator's homes's tunnel`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`force` params=`force/true ~ take foreign targets too`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ familiar · force

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`familiar` params=`takes/pet-name ~ the familiar whose hooks a home tend seats; absent, the one already seated stands`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`force` params=`~ take a foreign target too; the ledger keeps its bytes`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/hand ~ writes this host's files under the host and radius locks; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · root-repo-only · staged-repo-read-only · consent-withheld

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`~ name one of read, tend, verify, undo`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`root-repo-only` params=`~ root= names a checkout, and only lares repo keeps one`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`staged-repo-read-only` params=`~ staged=true reads the index, and only lares repo read reads it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`consent-withheld` params=`cure/[[engine.home.tends]] ~ the home tend writes the operator's homes; answer y at the terminal, or pass yes=true`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ tended · drift · foreign · unreachable

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`tended` params=`exit/0 fields/[[radius wrote set stores lifted refused generation rows exit]] ~ every item holds after the write; generation names the ledger entry`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`drift` params=`exit/1 fields/[[radius rows exit]] ~ an item still drifts`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`foreign` params=`exit/3 fields/[[radius refused rows exit]] ~ a foreign target refused; force=true takes it`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`unreachable` params=`exit/4 fields/[[radius rows exit]] ~ a store write failed`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

